# Pairs with ScopelessToolsClusterWide. The permission resolver treats a
# Telemetry rule over a tenant's capability scope as cluster-wide, so a
# tenant-confined grant (#5582) is advertised the MCP telemetry tools.
MODULE: CapabilityScopeCarriesTelemetry
TARGET: ScopelessToolsClusterWide
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the resolver carries Telemetry from a tenant capability rule

--- FIND
TelemetryCarriedFrom == {ClusterWideTreeId}
--- REPLACE
TelemetryCarriedFrom == {ClusterWideTreeId, TenantCapability("A")}
--- END
